   "width": 520,
   "height": 110,
   "text": "# The factory\nThe product is the system that builds the code: specs, agents, gates, feedback loops, guardrails.",
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "issue",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -560,
   "y": -80,
   "width": 200,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "**GitHub issue**\nlabel `factory`"
  },
  {
   "id": "intake",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -300,
   "y": -80,
   "width": 200,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "**Intake**\nworth building? scope? risk?",
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "spec",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -40,
   "y": -80,
   "width": 200,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "**Spec writer**\nacceptance criteria"
  },
  {
   "id": "build",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 220,
   "y": -80,
   "width": 200,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "**Builder**\ntests first, small PR"
  },
  {
   "id": "gate",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 480,
   "y": -80,
   "width": 200,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "**Gate** (script)\nchecks.sh from `main`",
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "review",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 740,
   "y": -200,
   "width": 220,
   "height": 160,
   "text": "**Reviewers**\ncode · ui · security\nrouted by risk, never weaker than the floor",
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "approve",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1000,
   "y": -80,
   "width": 200,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "**Approver**\nAPPROVE or ESCALATE",
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "merge",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1260,
   "y": -180,
   "width": 180,
   "height": 80,
   "text": "**Merge PR**\n`gh pr merge`",
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "human",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1260,
   "y": 20,
   "width": 180,
   "height": 80,
   "text": "**Needs human**\nYOUR CALL",
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "info",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -300,
   "y": 100,
   "width": 200,
   "height": 100,
   "text": "NEEDS-INFO: asks the author\nREJECT: says why"
  },
  {
   "id": "fail",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 300,
   "y": 120,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 70,
   "text": "FAIL: builder gets the log, no reviewer runs"
  },
  {
   "id": "changes",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 580,
   "y": 230,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 70,
   "text": "CHANGES: the same builder fixes it (max 3 rounds)"
  },
  {
   "id": "state",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -300,
   "y": 320,
   "width": 520,
   "height": 140,
   "text": "## State\n`job.json` is written only by `factory/bin/job.py`. Illegal moves are refused. Every move is logged with time and note; the dashboard reads it."
  },
  {
   "id": "guard",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 300,
   "y": 360,
   "width": 520,
   "height": 140,
   "text": "## Guardrails\nSandbox on, no bypass mode. Issue text is data. Protected paths. Secrets never reach the agent. Escalate: payments, auth, deploy, CI, migrations, new dependencies, public copy.",
   "color": "1"
  }
 ],
